  "ui.settings.components.autoKhanSettingsModal.at.or.above.this.threshold.auto.khan.e1d0e5a1": "At or above this threshold, Auto Khan opens the main castle gates once for six hours and immediately stops attacks, cooldown skips, and new taunts. The feature stays soft-locked without changing your settings; after the gate expires, it refreshes defense and resumes only when the projected offensive wall count is below the threshold. This uses the game's current ruby cost for the six-hour open-gate option.",
